WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,757
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,557 --> 00:00:03,414
Maya's lemonade is so slow today.

3
00:00:04,214 --> 00:00:05,251
The cups wait and wait.

4
00:00:06,051 --> 00:00:06,528
Who can help?

5
00:00:07,328 --> 00:00:08,585
The tall tower watches.

6
00:00:09,385 --> 00:00:10,722
Its needle goes into the red.

7
00:00:11,522 --> 00:00:12,299
The bell rings.

8
00:00:13,099 --> 00:00:13,706
Too busy!

9
00:00:14,506 --> 00:00:17,413
The book remembers every visit, one print after another.

10
00:00:18,213 --> 00:00:20,270
The blue paper shows how the stand should look.

11
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:21,817
A big pitcher!

12
00:00:22,617 --> 00:00:23,834
Maya has a tiny one.

13
00:00:24,634 --> 00:00:25,531
Something changed.

14
00:00:26,331 --> 00:00:28,138
The yellow string follows the lemonade.

15
00:00:28,938 --> 00:00:30,485
Here it turns thick and orange.

16
00:00:31,285 --> 00:00:32,042
The slow spot!

17
00:00:32,842 --> 00:00:34,269
Maya taps the tiny pitcher.

18
00:00:35,069 --> 00:00:35,816
It grows big.

19
00:00:36,616 --> 00:00:37,813
The string turns yellow.

20
00:00:38,613 --> 00:00:39,740
The cups fill fast!

21
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:47,497
That is CloudWatch, CloudTrail, Config and X-Ray: they show what is busy, who came, what changed and where it is slow.

22
00:00:48,297 --> 00:00:49,774
Check out the Cloud Town books.

23
00:00:50,574 --> 00:00:51,431
Link in the bio.

24
00:00:52,231 --> 00:00:53,138
See you next time!

